  ⭐ The word "transition point" never appears on screen. Storage holds points but the user reads ranges, so the app bridges the gap. One row 9 AM — 10 PM · 26℃ is really two points.

  Three places where the screen does the work

  - Weekday grouping — storage keeps each day separately, but the screen groups Mon–Fri
  - Off ranges — storage just has no setpoint_c, but it is drawn as 12 AM — 9 AM · off. Otherwise midnight-to-opening would vanish
  - Sunday — a day with no rows at all, so it says off all day

  Tapping the "Recent actions" or "Settings" tab shows "not drawn yet" — a blank screen would look broken.

  ⚠️ app.dart on the laptop currently opens at /draft/schedule. Revert it to start from home, or leave it since the tabs get you there.

